   "html": "<div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:0\"><span class=\"chip\">Two checks</span></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:1\"><h1 class=\"h1\">Two checks. <mark class=\"wipe-hl\">Neither was in my first draft.</mark></h1></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:2\"><div class=\"row2 tall\"><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"idx\">01</span><h3>Multiplicity</h3><p>Running a very large number of tests at the same time.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"idx\">02</span><h3>Leakage</h3><p>Marking your own work fairly.</p></div></div></div>",
