   "html": "<div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:0\"><h1 class=\"display xl\"><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:0\">T</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:1\">h</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:2\">a</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:3\">n</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:4\">k</span> <span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:6\">y</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:7\">o</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:8\">u</span><span class=\"ch\" style=\"--k:9\">.</span></h1></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:1\"><p class=\"thai\" lang=\"th\">ขอบคุณครับ</p></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:2\"><p class=\"byline\"><strong>Muhammad Dandy Nugraha · Wisnu Ananta Kusuma</strong><br><span>Department of Bioinformatics, IPB University</span></p></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:3\"><p class=\"contact\"><span>muhammad_dandy@apps.ipb.ac.id</span><span>ipb.link/triu-nugraha-2026</span></p></div><div class=\"r foot\" style=\"--i:4\"><p class=\"aside\">Extra slides: validation design · software comparison · protein structure</p></div>",
   "notes": "That is my ten minutes. Thank you. ขอบคุณครับ. I have extra slides on the validation design, the software comparison, and the protein structure, so please ask me about any of them.",
   "notes_id": "Itu sepuluh menit saya. Terima kasih. ขอบคุณครับ. Saya punya slide tambahan untuk desain validasi, perbandingan perangkat lunak, dan struktur protein, jadi silakan tanyakan yang mana pun.",
   "bridge": "",
   "direction": "Berhenti bersih. Jangan ambil rubik lagi. Berdiri tegak, diam, tunggu pertanyaan pertama.",
