   "title": "Validation design",
   "label": "Backup · Validation design",
   "html": "<div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:0\"><span class=\"chip\">Backup A · Validation design</span></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:1\"><h1 class=\"h1\">Validation design</h1></div><div class=\"stack\"><div class=\"r card line two\" style=\"--i:2\"><div><h3>Non-nested</h3><p>Screening and tuning fitted on the full cohort.</p></div><span class=\"val\">AUC 0.687 ± 0.081</span></div><div class=\"r card line two\" style=\"--i:3\"><div><h3>Nested</h3><p>Both confined to each outer training fold.</p></div><span class=\"val strong\">AUC 0.497 · 95% CI 0.346–0.648 · accuracy 48.4%</span></div></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:4\"><p class=\"aside\">Median split z = −0.179 · 46 HIGH / 45 LOW</p></div>",
