   "html": "<div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:0\"><span class=\"chip\">Backup B · Software comparison</span></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:1\"><h1 class=\"h1\">Software comparison</h1></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:2\"><p class=\"caption\">Table 1. Correlation with KDR expression for two descriptor sets computed from the same images.</p><table class=\"t1\"><thead><tr><th>Descriptor set</th><th>Patients</th><th>Tested</th><th>Nominal</th><th>FDR q&lt;0.05</th><th>Min q</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pre-computed BraTS</td><td>91</td><td>704</td><td>61</td><td>0</td><td>0.530</td></tr><tr><td>Re-extracted PyRadiomics</td><td>86</td><td>1098</td><td>682</td><td>479</td><td>0.010</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:3\"><p class=\"aside\">479 represents a few underlying dimensions expressed repeatedly, not 479 independent findings.</p></div><div class=\"r \" style=\"--i:4\"><p class=\"aside strong\">CXCL8 also survived correction (q = 0.039).</p></div>",
